  "description": "I woke up inside a dystopian game...\nA world with no dreams, no hope, and definitely no mercy.\n\nMy assigned mission?\nTrack down the fanatics and bring peace back to the world.\n\nBut...\n\n\"How am I supposed to save the world in a three-year-old’s body?!\"\n\nThe order is on the verge of collapse.\nI rescued the pitiful protagonist of the game...\nonly to somehow end up taking his place.\n\nNow I’m the Pope.\nBut this place is crawling with fanatics secretly worshiping an evil god, and spies from the royal court.\n\nEven the holy knights who are left... have completely lost it.\n\n\"Daddy! Call me Daddy, Master!\"\n\"I told you, I’m the Pope, not Master!\"\n\"You're so cute! You need to eat a hundred meals a day!\"\n\"Shut it.\"\n\nAs both a healer and the Pope, I need someone to play the role of my \"Daddy\" and protect me.\n\nThe problem?\nEvery single one of my Daddy candidates is completely unhinged.\nAnd even the male lead I let go so he could live a happy life...\n\n\"As long as I have you, I don’t care if the world burns.\"\n\n...seems to have come back not quite right in the head.\n\nCan our crumbling order really survive and bring peace to the world?\n\nWatch the Baby Pope sweat it out to save the world! (Cr TL: GS Team)",
